  "description": "Domain-layer seams for Dignite.Abp.FlexFields: IFlexField (the Entity contract a downstream's field-definition entity implements, e.g. a CMS's Field) and IFlexFieldRepository<TField>, plus IFlexFieldProvider<TEntity> (the contract a downstream host implements to resolve its entity's flex fields), IFlexFieldValidator<TEntity>, IFlexFieldIndexManager<TEntity> and IFlexFieldQueryExecutor<TEntity>. FlexFieldExtensions.ToFlexFieldData() bridges a downstream's IFlexField to the DDD-free FlexFieldData from Dignite.Abp.FlexFields.Abstractions. The kernel owns no field or host model of its own.",
